used under the MIT License. The original license and copyright notice are
kept in the LICENSE file.

TeamOS adds a company layer on top of Kaneo (people, attendance, the
desktop agent, payroll, expenses, files, chat, reports and more) and renames
the product in its user interface. Internal identifiers such as the
`@kaneo/*` package names and the `KANEO_*` environment variables are kept
from Kaneo for compatibility.

"Kaneo" is the name of the original project; TeamOS is not affiliated
with or endorsed by the Kaneo project.
